# Presentation / UI

Applies to `presentation/` (shared, combat, inventory, worlds).

## Ownership

- Layout, themes, animations, input handling
- Binding labels to domain state via signals or GameState
- Window overlay behavior (`window_manager.gd` / `gerenciador_janela.gd`)
- All visible strings through `tr("KEY")`

## Must NOT

- Implement combat damage formulas
- Grant/spend gold without signaling to core/GameState
- Serialize save directly — request save via service
- Embed business rules in button handlers beyond "emit signal / call service"

## Patterns

- `@onready` references only within same scene tree
- Subpanels: `visibility_changed` signal when opening/closing
- Drag-drop UI delegates validation to inventory domain
- Click-through rects: expose `get_clickable_rects()` for window manager

## Overlay

- Test with Embed Game **disabled**
- Coordinate width changes with `window_manager.ajustar_largura`

## Layout

- **Containers first** — `VBoxContainer` / `HBoxContainer` / `GridContainer`; `separation` and spacers instead of manual `offset_*`.
- **No hardcoded menu band heights** — use `OverlayVBox` + `UiConstants.COMBAT_RESERVED_SPACE`.
- Absolute position only for dynamic canvases, popups, and `WindowManager` — see `docs/conventions/ui-layout.md`.

## UI workflow (agents)

- Follow `/edit-ui-screens` → `.cursor/skills/edit-ui-screens/references/project-ui-patterns.md`
- **Doc-first:** design from `docs/conventions/ui-layout.md` + style tokens — do not clone existing panels as visual templates
- **Never** use removed `scaffold_ui_panel.py`
- **Wiring only** from `inventory_menu.gd` / `InventoryPanelRouter` — not visual chrome
- After layout edits: `run_edit_ui_validation.ps1 -ScopePng <id>` + capture-menu-screens scoped PNG review
- Humans may polish in Godot **ui_builder** — still run validation after save

